ock\">1. ch10:2.7</span></span>With the notation of <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh10_RauchComparisonTheorem%23rem%3Adc-ch10-2-6\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch10_RauchComparisonTheorem#rem:dc-ch10-2-6\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-72656d3a64632d636831302d322d36\">section 1</a>, set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$V_r=\\operatorname {vol}B_r(p)$\">$V_r=\\operatorname {vol}B_r(p)$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\widetilde V_r=\\operatorname {vol}B_r(\\tilde p)$\">$\\widetilde V_r=\\operatorname {vol}B_r(\\tilde p)$</span>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\operatorname {Ric}_M\\geq H$\">$\\operatorname {Ric}_M\\geq H$</span>, then for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$R\\geq r&gt;0$\">$R\\geq r&gt;0$</span> <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\frac{V_r}{\\widetilde V_r}\\geq \\frac{V_R}{\\widetilde V_R}.  \\]\">\\[  \\frac{V_r}{\\widetilde V_r}\\geq \\frac{V_R}{\\widetilde V_R}.  \\]</span> For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$R\\leq \\operatorname {diam}(M)$\">$R\\leq \\operatorname {diam}(M)$</span>, equality holds exactly when <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$B_R(p)$\">$B_R(p)$</span> is isometric to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$B_R(\\tilde p)$\">$B_R(\\tilde p)$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch10_RauchComparisonTheorem#rem:dc-ch10-2-6","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch10_RauchComparisonTheorem#thm:dc-ch10-3-1","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch09_VariationsOfEnergy#rem:dc-ch9-3-6","title":"rem:dc-ch9-3-6","label":"rem:dc-ch9-3-6"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch10_RauchComparisonTheorem#rem:dc-ch10-2-6","title":"rem:dc-c